  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide opportunities to 100 girls for education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will empower 100 girls from rural communities and help them to acquire skills and support they need in order for them to aspire high education. Leadership trainings, coupled with mentorship and space for self-guided learning will not only allow these girls to feel motivated and ready to fight for education but it will also create solidarity and support among themselves.</narrative>
